ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi272: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with single edge; wire has only one edge (V1->V2); loop_e1: (0,0,0)->(1,0,0) single segment — trivial wire has <2 edges; CheckLoop must skip multi-vertex detection on degenerate wire IS guard defect; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; EDGE_CURVE IS wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
